#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This function should never be used. It does not work for encodings which "
#| "have state, and unnecessarily treats single bytes differently from "
#| "multibyte sequences. Use the function B<mbtowc> instead."
msgid ""
"This function should never be used.  It does not work for encodings which "
"have state, and unnecessarily treats single bytes differently from multibyte "
"sequences.  Use either B<mbtowc>(3)  or the thread-safe B<mbrtowc>(3)  "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Esta función no debería usarse nunca. No funciona para codificaciones con "
"estado e innecesariamente trata bytes únicos de forma diferente de las "
"secuencias multibyte. En su lugar, use la función B<mbtowc>."

